{"id":"1024915739","kind":"answer","title":"有没有什么好用的手机学习软件？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"AnkiX高考","date":"2020-02-19","updated":"2020-02-19","votes":17,"comment_count":1,"minutes":1,"chars":337,"keywords":["间隔重复","长期记忆","检索练习","Anki","遗忘曲线"],"summary":"我推荐 Anki Anki 是一个能够 记笔记 、以 自测 的形式复习、有复习安排 算法 的软件。 用 Anki 复习笔记是这样的： 英语： 左边是正面问题，右边是背面答案 生物： 化学： Anki 会详细记录每次复习（自测）的情况： 我高二到高三用 Anki 记了超多笔记： 还没高三 的同学可以上手试试（高三的同学还是别刷知…","question_detail_html":"<p>想利用空闲时间学习，目前高二，想问问大家有没有什么好的学习软件推荐，各个学科的或者综合的都行，学语言的也可以。另外题主是美术生，有关于美术的软件也可以推荐，谢谢大家啦(◦˙▽˙◦)</p>","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/371776835/answer/1024915739","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"ZndY4bCV\">我推荐 <b>Anki</b></p><p data-pid=\"2wACV3h9\">Anki 是一个能够<b>记笔记</b>、以<b>自测</b>的形式复习、有复习安排<b>算法</b>的软件。</p><p data-pid=\"jwUTn9hZ\">用 Anki 复习笔记是这样的：</p><p data-pid=\"qoAE7_NK\">英语：</p><figure data-size=\"small\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-192326b8463b4328472845fe78c823c3_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-7aff51b7b3183166b582ebcd3e97048a\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-dd21f281c773417770ceea3d08fb7cbe_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1081\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-192326b8463b4328472845fe78c823c3_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-7aff51b7b3183166b582ebcd3e97048a\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-dd21f281c773417770ceea3d08fb7cbe_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1081\"/><figcaption>左边是正面问题，右边是背面答案</figcaption></figure><p data-pid=\"3Wo3LXxP\">生物：</p><figure data-size=\"small\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-7593ec449d9c091b6ece07673ebb9cf2_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-06d34c250f415f90699f6df834d717b7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-dbcd67da83122a7178fb0f1d2cae9a77_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1081\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-7593ec449d9c091b6ece07673ebb9cf2_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-06d34c250f415f90699f6df834d717b7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-dbcd67da83122a7178fb0f1d2cae9a77_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1081\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"CZN7GBpe\">化学：<br/></p><figure data-size=\"small\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-cdd32379e563b6d2bafbe95ddc423c2a_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-21e4bf3d8f30be2013c397a11d6f8761\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-48541310be5afa9e24f2b6c4ae157944_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1081\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-cdd32379e563b6d2bafbe95ddc423c2a_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-21e4bf3d8f30be2013c397a11d6f8761\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-48541310be5afa9e24f2b6c4ae157944_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1081\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"mTi0UA9m\">Anki 会详细记录每次复习（自测）的情况：</p><figure data-size=\"small\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-3f0b47e1c3a16ed0d7333ca705386b86_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-4656fb6641ab088b865ff9d4f09f1d8e\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-c1714128aa3114bfb8e40e7983f24f75_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1080\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-3f0b47e1c3a16ed0d7333ca705386b86_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-4656fb6641ab088b865ff9d4f09f1d8e\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-c1714128aa3114bfb8e40e7983f24f75_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1080\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"GQyrpNxt\">我高二到高三用 Anki 记了超多笔记：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-6d2a398d3d7431d948845a552b105c41_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-f28783859e92a8d441904f255b792903\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-2f51b4f7a58be466e408e711fa3ae7ca_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"540\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-6d2a398d3d7431d948845a552b105c41_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-f28783859e92a8d441904f255b792903\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-2f51b4f7a58be466e408e711fa3ae7ca_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"540\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"SyLuU43c\"><b>还没高三</b>的同学可以上手试试（高三的同学还是别刷知乎了）</p><p data-pid=\"v372aJKE\">下面是我高考前的统计数据：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-9df4555ff3ff0743ee50d92c09b51c0a\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-9df4555ff3ff0743ee50d92c09b51c0a_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1665\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-9df4555ff3ff0743ee50d92c09b51c0a\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-9df4555ff3ff0743ee50d92c09b51c0a_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1665\"/><figcaption>这个是电脑端的统计数据</figcaption></figure><p data-pid=\"sw3bxZbV\">Anki 相关的认知科学理论：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"RV9bAhSa\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"57020308\" href=\"#/post/57020308\">间隔重复</a></li><li data-pid=\"_R-jfxrb\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"57113246\" href=\"#/post/57113246\">测试效应</a></li><li data-pid=\"cmjqu-s_\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/57139724\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">穿插练习</a></li></ul><hr/><p data-pid=\"faqNwD2y\">Anki 支持 windows、mac、linux、安卓、苹果等常见设备，并且可以多端同步，走到哪学到哪。</p><p data-pid=\"2oe1rMSy\">为了帮到有缘人，我写了一份快速上手教程：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-2e8a109841199b0a18e70ae7bd16ea66_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"535\" data-image-width=\"1220\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/61564332\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">叶峻峣：B 站 Ankidroid 视频教程与电子书(全平台教程)快速通道</a>","rec_chain":[{"id":"57020308","title":"【理论】Study smarter, NOT longer. 你需要间隔重复！","author":"Osmosis from Elsevier","votes":135,"minutes":3,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"57113246","title":"【理论】测试效应——什么？考试有助于我的学习？","author":"Osmosis from Elsevier","votes":105,"minutes":2,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"46855765","title":"使用Anki准备大型考试的设置","author":"Anki","votes":41,"minutes":7,"reason":"延伸深读 · Anki"},{"id":"46533104","title":"疑问:Anki 没有向我展示我的所有卡片！","author":"Anki","votes":12,"minutes":11,"reason":"延伸深读 · Anki"},{"id":"46856037","title":"我要去度假。我可以暂停复习程序吗？","author":"Anki","votes":16,"minutes":2,"reason":"延伸深读 · Anki"},{"id":"38306259","title":"简单常见记忆误区解惑","author":"SuperMemo","votes":29,"minutes":6,"reason":"延伸深读 · SuperMemo"},{"id":"677540148","title":"一些创新洞察依赖于长期记忆","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":19,"minutes":2,"reason":"延伸深读 · Andy Matuschak"}],"r